# Netlify & Cloudflare Cache Invalidation Rules for Trends Box

# 1. HTML entry files - NEVER cache (forces browser to fetch latest JS bundle on new deployment)
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

# 2. Service Worker - NEVER cache (ensures browser always checks for SW updates)
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

# 3. Hashed assets - Cache forever (Vite generates unique hash on every build)
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
